## DATMM Dataset Record: Children's Oncology Group (COG)
## ---------------------------------------------------------

@prefix datmm:  <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/datmm/> .
@prefix dct:    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix foaf:   <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
